# 统一文本文件行尾为 LF：仓库存储与工作区检出均为 LF，
# 消除 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，保证跨平台（Windows/macOS/Linux）一致。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 需要在 Windows 原生执行的脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做任何行尾转换，避免损坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mid binary
*.midi binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.m4a binary
*.flac binary
*.han binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
